"\n"
"갱신하거나 업그레이드할 등급을 선택해 주세요:"

#: src/presentation/bot/handlers/premium.py:72
msgid ""
"<b>Premium</b> filters your /feed to highly rated profiles.\n"
"\n"
"Pick a tier:"
msgstr ""
"<b>프리미엄</b>은 /feed 에서 평점이 높은 프로필만 보여줘요.\n"
"\n"
"등급을 선택해 주세요:"

#: src/presentation/bot/handlers/premium.py:106
msgid "Unknown tier"
msgstr "알 수 없는 등급이에요"

#: src/presentation/bot/handlers/premium.py:109
msgid "Invoice sent — pay in the chat"
msgstr "청구서를 보냈어요 — 채팅에서 결제해 주세요"

#: src/presentation/bot/handlers/premium.py:131
msgid "Unknown payment payload."
msgstr "알 수 없는 결제 정보예요."

#: src/presentation/bot/handlers/premium.py:142
msgid "This payment is not in our records."
msgstr "기록에 없는 결제예요."

#: src/presentation/bot/handlers/premium.py:156
msgid "✅ Payment confirmed."
msgstr "✅ 결제가 확인되었어요."

#: src/presentation/bot/handlers/premium.py:161
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<b>✅ Premium activated!</b>\n"
"Tier: {tier}\n"
"{expires}\n"
"Now /feed shows profiles rated >= {threshold}."
msgstr ""
"<b>✅ 프리미엄이 활성화되었어요!</b>\n"
"등급: {tier}\n"
"{expires}\n"
"이제 /feed 에는 평점 {threshold} 이상의 프로필이 표시돼요."

